#% title
# half_plane

#% text
# `half_plane([p1, p2], w) or half_plane(p, v, w)`: the half-plane bounded by the line through p1 and p2 (or through p along v), on the side of w

#% section
# Examples

#% subsection
# Basic examples

#% cell
h = half_plane([0, 0], [1, 0], [0, 1])

#% cell
[signed_region_distance(h, [2, -3]), region_member(h, [x, y])]
#% output
#= [3, element(x | y, reals) and y >= 0]

